  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU4FORESTS - UNDP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project builds on a comprehensive assessment of the forestry sector&#x2019;s challenges related to climate change and prioritizes key adaptation measures to ensure sustainable forest development in Albania. It is closely linked to the ongoing UNDP National Adaptation Plan (NAP) Process Project, financed by the Green Climate Fund (GCF). This initiative seeks to address institutional gaps in municipal forestry management, where responsibilities are often misplaced within municipal structures, leading to inefficiencies and uncoordinated services.</narrative>
  </description>
